  "job_B3.2.49_20251003_114643": {
    "text": "Vs is on \u00feysum d\u00e6ge to wur\u00f0igenne \u00feyses temples symelnyss, for\u00feam \u00fee hit is gehalgud gode to lofe &\nRihtlice eal cristen folc \u00fe\u00e6re haligan ciercean symelnysse wyr\u00f0a\u00f0.\nSyu is ure gastlice modur; for\u00feam \u00fee we sint \u00feurh hi on \u00feam haligan fullwihte geedcennede, & to \u00feam\nWitudlice on \u00fe\u00e6re forman acennince \u00fee we \u00feurh wer & \u00feurh wif on \u00feis lif becomon, we wurdun yrres\n\u00deurh \u00fea o\u00fere acennednesse \u00fee we on \u00feam fullwihte geedcennede wurdun, we geearnedon \u00fe\u00e6t we sint\nSiu forme acennednes us for\u00f0 gel\u00e6dde to dea\u00f0e & to ecium tintr\u00e6gum.\nSiu o\u00feer us ongen gecigde to \u00feam ecean life.\nEalle we w\u00e6run \u00e6r \u00feam fulwihte deofles templu; & gif we geornlice embe ure sawle h\u00e6lu \u00feencea\u00f0\nGod earda\u00f0 na \u00fe\u00e6t an on \u00feam templum \u00fee sint \u00feurh manna handa of trywum & of stanum getimbrude,\n\u00de\u00e6t is on urum ge\u00feiode, godes halige tempel is \u00fe\u00e6t ge sint.\n\u00deas templu \u00fee we ciercean nemna\u00f0 sint getimbrude of trywum & of stanum to \u00feam \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea lifigendan\nVs is swi\u00f0e micelum to geblissynne for\u00feam \u00fe\u00e6t we gearnian mostun \u00fe\u00e6t we sint godes templu; & vs is\nVs is to adr\u00e6denne \u00fe\u00e6t se apostol be \u00feam cwi\u00f0, Si quis templum dei uiolauerit disperdet illum deus.\nHe cwi\u00f0, gif hwylc man godes tempel gewem\u00f0 god hine forspil\u00f0.\nSe \u00e6lmihtiga drihten \u00fee \u00feurh his micelan meahte getimbrude heofenas & eor\u00f0an, he gemedemude hyne\nNe gemete he on us \u00fee his templu sint, nan \u00feing hories \u00feurh un\u00feeawas, ne nan \u00feing \u00feystre, ne nan \u00feyng\nEala hwylc by\u00f0 seo unges\u00e6lige sawl \u00fee by\u00f0 fram gode forl\u00e6tenu, & fram deofle of\u00fericced.\nHio by\u00f0 leohtes ge\u00e6mtigud, & hio by\u00f0 \u00feystra gefylled, & hio by\u00f0 fram \u00e6lcere swettnesse ahladen, &\n& nu, men, nu god sylf wolde his templ of us gewyrcean & gemedemude \u00fe\u00e6t he on us eardian wolde;\nOnscunien we galscipe & healden we cl\u00e6nnesse, forhygcen we gytsunge & secen we mildheortnysse,\n& swa oft swa ge wyllen wur\u00feian ciercean symelnesse healde \u00e6lc man forh\u00e6fednesse wi\u00f0 his agenne\n& gif ge \u00fe\u00e6nne \u00feus mid gastlicum wurcum & mid gastlicum freolsungum to \u00fe\u00e6re ciercean becuma\u00f0,\n& \u00fe\u00e6t gedafena\u00f0 toforan eallum o\u00ferum \u00feingum \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lces mannes heorte beo wi\u00f0 ealle leahtras hwit &\nNe frama\u00f0 eow nan \u00feing \u00fe\u00e6t ge hwite \u00e6tywun beforan manna eagum, gif ge mid synnum gehorgude\nAc utun swa oft swa we to godes ciercean becuman wyllen, ure sawle acl\u00e6nsian mid haligum\nEalle \u00fea men \u00fee \u00feas haligan m\u00e6genu lufia\u00f0, & gelomlice hi began wylla\u00f0 hi gegladia\u00f0 hira drihten &\n\u00d0a menn \u00fe\u00e6nne \u00fee un\u00feeawas & leahtras lufia\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t is ofermettu, & idel wuldur, & andan, & yrre, &\n& \u00fea \u00fee on \u00e6negum \u00feingum wiglia\u00f0, o\u00f0\u00f0e be nytenum, o\u00f0\u00f0e be fugelum, o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00fea \u00fee hyra \u00e6lmessan\nEalle \u00fea cristenan men \u00fee \u00feyllice synt & \u00feas \u00feing lufia\u00f0 \u00feeh \u00fee hi to ciercean gan & hyra gebedu\nEac we witun \u00fe\u00e6t ealle cristene menn \u00fee sint ea\u00f0mode & cl\u00e6nheorte, & mildheorte, & arf\u00e6ste, &\nMen, utun we for\u00fean mid godes fultume eallum m\u00e6gene forfleon \u00feas heafudleahtras, & \u00fea l\u00e6ssan\nAlysan we d\u00e6ghwomlice mid syngalum gebedum & rumgifulum \u00e6lmesd\u00e6dum, \u00fey l\u00e6s \u00fee we \u00e6nigne\nSo\u00f0lice twegen sint gewilniende \u00fe\u00e6t hi on us eardian wylla\u00f0 ure drihten h\u00e6lenda cyning \u00fee us \u00feurh\nWarnige manna gehwylc hine \u00fe\u00e6t he Crist ne adrife ut of his eardungstowe \u00feurh synlice d\u00e6da, \u00fey l\u00e6s\nHealden we \u00fe\u00e6ne \u00e6festan cyning \u00fee us wile to ecere blisse gel\u00e6dan; \u00fe\u00e6nne ne \u00feurfe we us \u00fe\u00e6ne\nHealdan we \u00fe\u00e6t uplice leoht \u00fe\u00e6nne ne dyrrun us to geneal\u00e6cean \u00fea ni\u00feerlican \u00feystru; lufien we \u00fe\u00e6t\nGefyllun we ure sawle mid wyrtgemangum \u00fe\u00e6re haligan cl\u00e6nnysse, a\u00fewan we hi mid \u00e6lmesd\u00e6dum,\n& swa oft swa hit \u00e6nige freolsdagas beon sunnandagas, o\u00fe\u00fee m\u00e6ssedagas o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00feyllice wyr\u00feingdagas,\nToforan eallum o\u00ferum \u00feingum \u00fe\u00e6t nan man ne healde n\u00e6nne ni\u00f0, ne nane hatunge on his heortan\nSe \u00fe\u00e6nne \u00fee fur\u00feun anne mann hatige gehyre he hw\u00e6t se apostol cwy\u00f0, Qui odit fratrem suum\nHe cwy\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00fee his bro\u00feur hata\u00f0 si eal swa scyldig swa se mannslaga.\nHwylcun nebbe & mid hwylcere gederstinesse derr he geneal\u00e6cean to godes wiofude \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fe\u00e6s\n\u00dey is manna gehwylcum micel \u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00fee \u00e6r \u00e6nigne tionan o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00e6nigne graman his neahstan\n& \u00feam is eac micel \u00feearf \u00fee \u00fea \u00e6byle\u00fee \u00feola\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he hr\u00e6dlice forgifnysse sylle \u00fe\u00e6t he m\u00e6ge\n\u00de\u00e6t is, Drihten, forgif us ure gyltas swaswa we forgifa\u00f0 urum gyltendrum.\nNys eac nanum menn to forwyrnanne se haligdom \u00fe\u00e6s fullwihtes & huru \u00feinga \u00fe\u00e6nne man \u00fe\u00e6ne man\n\u00dea \u00fee forylda\u00f0 & forgymeleasia\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hi nella\u00f0 hira bearn to \u00feam fullwihte & to \u00fe\u00e6re onasettednysse\n& wite eac \u00e6ghwylc \u00fe\u00e6ra manna \u00fee o\u00feres onfeh\u00f0 \u00e6t fullwihte o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00e6t bisceopes handa \u00fe\u00e6t hi sint\nFor\u00feam\u00fee nan man ne m\u00e6g beon rihtlice geleaffull butun he \u00fe\u00e6t cunne, for\u00feam\u00fee he sceal on \u00feam\nIs eac nu \u00feam m\u00e6ssepreostum \u00fee to \u00feam gesette sint, \u00fe\u00e6t hi sceolun godes folc l\u00e6ran swi\u00f0e micel\n& swa hi magon ec witan \u00fe\u00e6t hi ecere susle & ecere tintrege onfo\u00f0 \u00e6t \u00e6lcum \u00fe\u00e6ra manna \u00fee on hira\nFor\u00feam \u00fee hit is awriten on haligum bocum & \u00feus cweden, Non solum qui faciunt sed etiam qui\n\u00de\u00e6t is, na \u00fea ane \u00fee unriht wyrcea\u00f0 ac ec ealle \u00fea \u00fee hit ge\u00feafia\u00f0 & his styran nylla\u00f0 beo\u00f0 eces dea\u00f0es\nAc utun we ealle swi\u00f0e iornlice urne hiht & ealne urne hopan on urne drihten fettan & hine\nVton nu, men, nu we ea\u00f0e magun & us god \u00fe\u00e6ne fyrst her on worulde forl\u00e6ten h\u00e6f\u00f0 godes wyllan\n\u00de\u00e6r is ece med, & \u00fe\u00e6r is lif butan dea\u00f0e, & \u00fe\u00e6r is gefea butan unrotnysse, & \u00fe\u00e6r is leoht butan",
